E5%8D%A1%E6%88%8E\" title=\"卡戎\"><img alt=\"卡戎\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-312801.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/22/HeadIconSmall-312801.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E6%88%8E\" title=\"卡戎\">卡戎</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.7</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>21又1</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：312803</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"5\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">额外</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"5\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-额外.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-额外 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3128/312803/卡戎-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">幻象中，神眷的光芒笼罩着那状若天使的来者。<br />无人知道他是什么以及应当如何称呼他，毕竟穿越死亡幽谷又折返之人世间罕有。我们只能在弥留之人的嗫嚅间得知，那是至高无上的意象，一位垂眸的圣人，不为凡人立像的存在——在他穿梭期间，仁慈的圣爱为死者带来永恒的安宁。<br />他所涉足之处，所有在死亡帷幕前徘徊的人皆陷入超脱的迷醉；他目光所及之处，血色的百合自裹尸布与肋骨间生根发芽；他语言所至之处，引人入眠的歌声自天空洒落。<br />一切善者在他的揭露下，于死前得见乐园的一角，见证了那流淌着奶与蜜的土地。于是他们在忘我的激情中，以舞蹈般的步伐迈入甜蜜的死亡，来迎接那一份永恒的寂静。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"312803\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-312804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f0/Belonging-312804.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“告终与重生”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"End and Rebirth\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以使者的羽翼为灵感打造的头饰，传闻中受访者凭此吓退了对逝者不敬之物。<br />那些装饰在白羽上的红瞳或许怪异、凌冽，然而当我们来到受访者面前，比起直面“死亡”的恐惧，那抹寒意简直微不足道。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-312805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e5/Belonging-312805.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“白日将逝”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"In Night Calls the Reaper\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />25<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一柄巨大的月牙状镰刀，据传，其原材料出自大地最深处的黑岩，坚硬而强韧。<br />即使采访是在月亏时，它仍反射出凄寒的光。还好受访者只是用它来收割悔恨、罪恶与苦难。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-312806.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ac/Belonging-312806.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“生命的颤音”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Quivering with Life\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>用识别牌制成的一串串百合链饰。受访者借此铭记那些曾经绽放过、而又被历史车轮辗轧过的生命。<br />如果你尝试捧起这串银链，你还是会听到纷杂的轻颤，以及一声声鲜活的笑骂、一缕缕深夜的哀愁。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%901.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 亡者的恩赐1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%901.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%901.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%901.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%901.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%901.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%901.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%902.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 亡者的恩赐2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%902.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%902.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%902.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%902.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%902.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%81%A9%E8%B5%902.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">亡者的恩赐 <small style=\"color: grey\">Gift of the Dead</small></span></span>"}}